The '''Progression Missions''' is an event that is held at random times in [[The Battle Cats]]. This event features unique [[Missions]].

==Event Information==
Train up your Cats with {{Color|#FF9900|'''Progression Missions'''}}, on now!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from February 23, 2026 (11:00AM) until March 13, 2026 (10:59AM)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Special Missions added!'''}}<br>
Earn {{Color|#FF0000|'''XP'''}}, {{Color|#FF0000|'''Leadership'''}}, and {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cat Food'''}} and other items from three sets of limited Missions!

Earn 3 {{Color|#FF0000|'''Rare Tickets'''}} by clearing all Missions!<br>
Set 1: On from February 23 (11:00AM)<br>
Set 2: On from March 2 (11:00AM)<br>
Set 3: On from March 9 (11:00AM)

<nowiki>*</nowiki> Limited Special Missions will only be available until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the Missions disappear at the end of the event!

